# The site's public address. Everything derives from it: canonical URLs,
# hreflang, OpenGraph images, robots.txt, sitemap.xml, the JSON-LD and the
# contact line printed on the résumé PDF.
#
# Leave it unset on Vercel and the deployment's own domain is used — which is
# why https://matinzarifamin.vercel.app needs no configuration there
# (see next.config.ts). Set it once matinzarifamin.ir is bought:
#
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://matinzarifamin.ir
#
# Locally, copy this file to .env.local and point it at whatever you want the
# generated PDF to say — `npm run resume:pdf` prints what the dev server reads.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://matinzarifamin.vercel.app
